          "prompt": "Why raise a frequent winner’s threshold?",
          "answer": "0",
          "why": "A higher tipping line requires more input.",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "0",
              "text": "Reduce its immediate excitability"
            },
            {
              "id": "1",
              "text": "Make it fire more easily"
